{"id":"635340","name":"油豆角酱肉包","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/635340/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"东北油豆角","amount":"一把"},{"name":"卤猪肉","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"六棵"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许(40度左右)"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"东北的干油豆角，备用。","img":"images/635340/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡一夜，挤出多余水分。","img":"images/635340/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"剁碎。","img":"images/635340/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆瓣酱，备用。","img":"images/635340/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"油豆角、猪肉馅和葱放入盆中，加适量盐、一勺豆瓣酱、少许生抽、老抽、五香粉和鸡精调味。","img":"images/635340/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/635340/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面粉中加少许酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/635340/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搓成长条状,切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/635340/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/635340/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/635340/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/635340/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"冷水上笼。","img":"images/635340/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大火烧开转中火蒸二十分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/635340/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/635340/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"卖相不错。","img":"images/635340/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"松软。","img":"images/635340/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"掰开，香味扑鼻。","img":"images/635340/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}